      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T22:16:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The old code was resolving existing dependencies after creating variants using the logic in Blueprint that made a new variant depend on the matching variant of its dependencies if the matching variant existed.  TransitionMutators have to do that up front by setting the OutgoingTransition correctly.  If this doesn\u0027t set the transition for `staticVariantTag` then you end up with a dependency on the `\"\"` configuration of the static variant.",
      "parentUuid": "86014483_ddf675e7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 185,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 185,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "a70f45132c30875022652693f723cea4bdacdc48",
